title: Finn_Variables
---
<<declare $saleTotal = 0>>
===

title: Finn_SellFish
---
Finn: Hi there! What brings you to the dock today? #line:f1a2c3
-> I'd like to sell some fish. #line:f2b4d5
    <<jump Finn_TrySell>>
-> Not right now, maybe later. #line:f3c6e7
    Finn: No problem! I'll be here if you change your mind. #line:f4d8f9
===

title: Finn_TrySell
---
<<tryCalculateFishSale>>
<<set $saleTotal = calculateFishSale()>>

<<if $saleTotal > 0>>
    Finn: Great! Your fish are worth {$saleTotal} coins. #line:f5
    -> Yes, sell them now. #line:f6
        <<confirmFishSale>>
        <<jump Finn_SellSuccess>>
    -> Maybe later then. #line:f7
        <<jump Finn_SellCancel>>
<<else>>
    Finn: I see you don't have any fish to sell right now. #line:f8
    -> That's alright. #line:f9
        <<jump Finn_SellCancel>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Finn_SellSuccess
---
Finn: Perfect! Here's your {$saleTotal} coins. Thanks for selling with me! #line:f10
===

title: Finn_SellCancel
---
Finn: No worries! Come back when you have fish to sell. #line:f11
===